    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it feels a bit surface level. can u go deeper into the conservative side? u mentioned sanctity of life but there's usually more complex theological reasoning there than just \"it's God's will\"—like how they view the nature of suffering or the social implications of individual autonomy. can u expand on that?",
